graph TD
    %% Phage Infection
    A[Bacteriophage Attachment] --> B[Phage DNA Injection]
    B --> C[Foreign DNA Enters Cell]
    
    %% OR Gate 1: Which Defense System?
    C --> D{OR: Which<br/>Defense Active?}
    D -->|R-M System| E[Restriction-Modification]
    D -->|CRISPR-Cas| F[Adaptive Immunity]
    D -->|Abortive Infection| G[Suicide System]
    D -->|None| H[Infection Succeeds]
    
    %% R-M System Branch
    E --> I[Foreign DNA Recognition]
    I --> J{AND: DNA Unmethylated<br/>at Recognition Site?}
    J -->|No - Methylated| K[DNA Protected]
    J -->|Yes - Unmethylated| L[Restriction Enzyme Cleavage]
    
    L --> M{OR: Which<br/>Restriction Enzyme?}
    M -->|EcoRI| N[GAATTC Site Cleavage]
    M -->|EcoRV| O[GATATC Site Cleavage]
    M -->|Other| P[Other Sequence Cleavage]
    
    N --> Q[Phage DNA Fragmented]
    O --> Q
    P --> Q
    Q --> R[/DNA Degradation/]
    R --> S([Phage Destroyed])
    
    %% Self DNA Protection
    K --> T[Host DNA Methyltransferase]
    T --> U[Recognition Site Methylation]
    U --> V[Self DNA Protected]
    V --> W([Host Survives])
    
    %% CRISPR-Cas Branch
    F --> X{OR: Prior<br/>Exposure?}
    X -->|No - First Infection| Y[Adaptation Phase]
    X -->|Yes - Memory| Z[Interference Phase]
    
    %% CRISPR Adaptation
    Y --> AA[Cas1/Cas2 Complex]
    AA --> AB[Phage DNA Fragment Selection]
    AB --> AC[Protospacer Selection]
    AC --> AD{AND: PAM Sequence<br/>Adjacent?}
    AD -->|No| AE[/Not Suitable/]
    AD -->|Yes| AF[Spacer Integration]
    
    AF --> AG[CRISPR Array Expansion]
    AG --> AH[New Spacer Added]
    AH --> AI[Heritable Memory]
    AI --> AJ[Future Protection Acquired]
    
    %% CRISPR Interference
    Z --> AK[CRISPR Locus Transcription]
    AK --> AL[Pre-crRNA Synthesis]
    AL --> AM[Cas6 Endonuclease]
    AM --> AN[crRNA Processing]
    AN --> AO[Mature crRNAs]
    
    %% Cascade Complex Assembly
    AO --> AP{AND: All Cas Proteins<br/>Present?}
    AP -->|No| AQ[No Immunity]
    AP -->|Yes| AR[Cascade Complex Assembly]
    
    AR --> AS[Cas8/Cas11/Cas7 Complex]
    AS --> AT{AND: crRNA<br/>Loaded?}
    AT -->|No| AQ
    AT -->|Yes| AU[Active Surveillance Complex]
    
    %% Target Recognition
    AU --> AV[Foreign DNA Scanning]
    AV --> AW{AND: Spacer Match<br/>AND PAM Present?}
    AW -->|No| AX[No Match - Scanning Continues]
    AW -->|Yes| AY[Target Recognition]
    
    AY --> AZ[R-loop Formation]
    AZ --> BA[Cas3 Helicase-Nuclease Recruitment]
    BA --> BB[/Target DNA Degradation/]
    BB --> BC[Phage Genome Destroyed]
    BC --> BD([Phage Neutralized])
    
    %% Abortive Infection
    G --> BE[Infection Detected]
    BE --> BF[Toxin Activation]
    BF --> BG[Cell Suicide]
    BG --> BH[/DNA Replication Halted/]
    BH --> BI[/Phage Cannot Replicate/]
    BI --> BJ([Colony Protected])
    
    %% Failed Defense
    H --> BK[Phage Replication]
    BK --> BL[Progeny Phage Assembly]
    BL --> BM[Cell Lysis]
    BM --> BN([Infection Spreads])
    
    %% Self/Non-self Discrimination
    V --> BO{OR: Target<br/>DNA?}
    BO -->|Self| BP[Methylation Protects]
    BO -->|Foreign| BQ[Restriction Cleaves]
    BP --> W
    BQ --> S
    
